message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FRED – FaiR Experimental Designs"
abstract: "A toolkit for FAIR metadata management in omics research. FRED enables guided, dialog-based creation of standardized YAML metadata files, structured semantic validation, logical cross-file search, and export to community-standard formats."
